      "writtenOn": "2021-04-22T17:15:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried that when I first added the scl/sda config nodes. The issue is that gpio.dts is an overlay and we can\u0027t get a phandle from a board to an overlay. So that\u0027s not an option. The only things we can do is set them to the same enum-name. This still gives us compile time safety in that if the board references an enum, but the enum is never used in the overlay, the build will break.",
      "parentUuid": "d927c9bb_6edb0400",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "b46844ced866c9e4a2b61a73321a9569bef5c615",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
